          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 131983,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando você precisa usar <code>dotenv</code> no seu projeto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Quando você quer carregar variáveis de ambiente de um arquivo <code>.env</code> no seu aplicativo</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Quando suas variáveis de ambiente já estão definidas no sistema ou plataforma em que você está trabalhando, como o Mimo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Quando você quer carregar variáveis de ambiente de um arquivo <code>.env</code> no seu aplicativo.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Seu primeiro app mantém variáveis apenas em <code>.env</code>. O segundo já as tem carregadas pela plataforma.</p><p>Qual app precisa de <code>dotenv</code> para carregar suas variáveis antes da leitura?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Apenas o primeiro app</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Apenas o segundo app</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Os dois apps sempre precisam dele</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher Apenas o primeiro app.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 131978,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Importe a biblioteca correta para habilitar o uso de <code>load_dotenv</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" dotenv\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" os\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"dotenv.load_dotenv()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"api_key = os.getenv(\" /><text value=\"&quot;API_KEY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(api_key)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"13\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"12345-abcde-67890-fghij-12345\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>dotenv</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 131979,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Use o método correto para imprimir todas as variáveis de ambiente disponíveis.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" os\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(os.environ)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getenv\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;API_KEY&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"environ({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;API_KEY&quot;: &quot;12345-abcde-67890-fghij-12345&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;SECRET_KEY&quot;: &quot;mysecretkey&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  ...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"})\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>os</code> seguido de <code>.</code> e finalmente <code>environ</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Use o dicionário do ambiente para ler <code>API_KEY</code> e depois exiba todas as variáveis de ambiente disponíveis.</p><p>Armazene o dicionário em <code>variables</code>. Exiba primeiro o valor da chave e depois o dicionário inteiro.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"os\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"variables\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"os\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"environ\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"variables\" /><text value=\"[\" /><text value=\"&quot;API_KEY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"variables\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getenv\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;SECRET_KEY&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"variables[&quot;API_KEY&quot;]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"12345-abcde-67890-fghij-12345\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"environ({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;API_KEY&quot;: &quot;12345-abcde-67890-fghij-12345&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;SECRET_KEY&quot;: &quot;mysecretkey&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  ...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"})\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>os</code> seguido de <code>environ</code>, <code>\"API_KEY\"</code> e finalmente <code>variables</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4 - Copy -  - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 131980,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Certifique-se de definir um valor padrão caso o dicionário <code>os.environ</code> não contenha o que estamos procurando.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" os\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"api_key = os.environ.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;NON_EXISTENT_KEY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;default_value&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(api_key)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getenv\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"default_value\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>get</code> seguido de <code>\"NON_EXISTENT_KEY\"</code> e depois <code>,</code>, <code>\"default_value\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Defina um valor padrão caso o dicionário <code>os.environ</code> não contenha a chave necessária.</p><p>Recupere <code>NON_EXISTENT_KEY</code> com segurança para que o programa imprima <code>default_value</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" os\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"api_key = os.environ.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;NON_EXISTENT_KEY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;default_value&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(api_key)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"os.getenv\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"set\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;MY_API_KEY&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;missing&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"default_value\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>os.environ</code> seguido de <code>get</code>, <code>\"NON_EXISTENT_KEY\"</code> e finalmente <code>\"default_value\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 131984,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que <code>os.getenv(\"NON_EXISTENT_KEY\", \"default\")</code> retornará se a variável de ambiente não existir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ele retornará <code>\"default\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Isso gerará um erro</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Isso retornará <code>None</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ele retornará <code>\"default\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Seu ambiente contém <code>REGION=eu</code>, mas não tem a chave <code>MODE</code>.</p><p>O que <code>os.getenv(\"REGION\", \"local\")</code> e <code>os.getenv(\"MODE\", \"dev\")</code> retornam, nessa ordem?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"eu\"</code>, depois <code>\"dev\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"local\"</code>, depois <code>\"dev\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"eu\"</code>, depois <code>None</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>\"eu\"</code>, depois <code>\"dev\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          }
